            "school-match"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "match"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "整個籃球體育館擠滿了為我們學校校際比賽熱烈加油的學生。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/sports-match-cheering/1.mp3",
